# Using Decision-Aiding Software for Teaching in All Fields of Knowledge.

**Authors:** Nagel, Stuart, Bievenue, Lisa

## Abstract
Describes decision-aiding software, Policy/Goal Percentaging (P/G%), that can process a set of controversial alternatives when used with microcomputer-aided instruction. The benefits and objectives of microcomputer use are discussed, and applications of the software to problems in the fields of natural sciences, social sciences, and the humanities are presented. (17 references) (LRW)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ415279

